     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: NamingSystem moe-facility-id</b></p><a name=\"moe-facility-id\"> </a><a name=\"hcmoe-facility-id\"> </a><h3>Summary</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td>Defining URL</td><td>http://fhir.org.nz/ig/base/NamingSystem/moe-facility-id</td></tr><tr><td>Name</td><td>Moe_facility_id</td></tr><tr><td>Status</td><td>active</td></tr><tr><td>Definition</td><td><div><p>This identifier, known as the 'MoE Number' or 'School Number', is used by the education sector to identify an NZ education institution. These identifiers can be looked up at the [<a href=\"http://educationcounts.govt.nz\">educationcounts.govt.nz</a>](<a href=\"https://www.educationcounts.govt.nz/directories/list-of-nz-schools\">https://www.educationcounts.govt.nz/directories/list-of-nz-schools</a>) website.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td>Publisher</td><td>HL7 New Zealand</td></tr></table><h3>Identifiers</h3><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Value</b></td><td><b>Preferred</b></td><td><b>Period</b></td></tr><tr><td>URI</td><td>https://standards.digital.health.nz/ns/moe-facility-id</td><td>true</td><td>2024-07-20 --&gt; (ongoing)</td></tr></table></div>"
